WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.150
For a studio workload review, first group the queue by Studio and read each heading and count.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:12.690
Use Then by to compare priority inside a single studio; collapsing a group only hides its rows.

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:19.555
Before reporting a backlog, inspect the scope and sort order so a display choice is not mistaken for a change in workload.
